name: sim.matrixToPose
description: Converts a transformation matrix to a pose
luaSynopsis: list pose = sim.matrixToPose(list matrix)
pythonSynopsis: float[7] pose = sim.matrixToPose(float[12] matrix)
inputs:
1. matrix: input matrix (array of 12 values [Vx0 Vy0 Vz0 P0 Vx1 Vy1 Vz1 P1 Vx2 Vy2 Vz2 P2])
outputs:
1. pose: the output pose (array of 7 values [x y z qx qy qz qw])
